WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.054
Climate change is a global

2
00:00:02.054 --> 00:00:03.774
problem. But who should do

3
00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:05.287
how much to fix it?

4
00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:08.423
The UN climate convention was

5
00:00:08.423 --> 00:00:10.712
agreed at Rio in 1992.

6
00:00:10.712 --> 00:00:12.280
Kyoto, in 1997,

7
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.459
set binding cuts for rich

8
00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:16.171
countries. Paris,

9
00:00:16.171 --> 00:00:16.898
in 2015,

10
00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:18.763
asked every country to set

11
00:00:18.763 --> 00:00:20.427
its own targets.

12
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.583
India's core principle is C-B-D-R:

13
00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:26.596
common but differentiated responsibilities.

14
00:00:27.323 --> 00:00:28.951
Paris aims to keep warming

15
00:00:28.951 --> 00:00:30.469
well below two degrees,

16
00:00:30.469 --> 00:00:31.821
and to pursue one and

17
00:00:31.821 --> 00:00:32.602
a half.

18
00:00:32.602 --> 00:00:35.563
Through nationally determined contributions.

19
00:00:35.924 --> 00:00:37.101
Your turn.

20
00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:38.731
Which agreement?
